## Goal
Clicking the schedule home week label opens a week picker; choosing a week updates the schedule viewer for that session only.

## Approach
1. Export week groups lookup / allow `getScheduleState(date, weekNumber?)` so UI can override week while keeping today/day-of-week from `date`.
2. In `ScheduleHomeScreen`, hold `viewWeek` in React state defaulting to calendar week; derive `schedule` from override.
3. Replace the static `<p>` with a button + absolute menu listing weeks 1–8 (label + Mon–Thu groups). Close on select / outside click / Escape.
4. Unit-test week override on `getScheduleState`; keep home smoke text assertion compatible (button text still matches).

## Non-goals
URL/localStorage persistence; changing series routing.